    <span class="section-label">Honest comparison</span>
    <h1>WordPress vs. <em>a custom-coded site.</em></h1>
    <p>WordPress powers about 40% of the internet. It also accounts for the overwhelming majority of hacked websites on the internet. That is not an accident; it is the result of a specific architecture. Here is the honest tradeoff.</p>
  </div>
